Callback for instrument change notifications.

Implement this on iOS/Android side to receive notifications when
instrument data changes via WS push.

# Kotlin Usage
```kotlin
facade.registerInstrumentChangeListener(object : InstrumentChangeListener {
override fun onInstrumentChanged() {
// refresh UI
}
})
```

